00:35:46.000 --> 00:36:12.000
like the initiatives like the giving pledge, which are really interesting. and actually we're doing a bunch of studies on them. I don't know what's individually motivating each of the members of the giving pledge, and these are billionaires who have pledged upwards of 50% of their fortunes to different charitable causes. I think it's a wonderful endeavor. I don't know what's specifically motivating them. There are lots of different motivations, including some tax benefits.

